Note on the data

The MIT license above covers the code, documentation and generated figures and
tables in this repository. It does not cover the underlying medical images or
their segmentations, neither of which is distributed here.

The images are the UPENN-GBM collection, deposited at The Cancer Imaging
Archive under doi:10.7937/TCIA.709X-DN49 by S. Bakas and colleagues, and
released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license
(CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.

The tumor segmentations are the BAMF annotations of that collection, released
under the same license and deposited under doi:10.5281/zenodo.8345959.

CC BY 4.0 permits reuse and redistribution provided the source is credited.
Both sources are credited in README.md and docs/references.md, and the
acquisition gate in this repository checks on every run that the licence the
publishing services report is still CC BY 4.0.
